msgstr "(c) 1999 - 2001 Konqueror razvojni tim"

#: pluginopts.cpp:66
msgid "Enable plugins globally"
msgstr "Omogući pluginove globalno"

#: pluginopts.cpp:72
msgid ""
"Enables the execution of plugins that can be contained in HTML pages, e.g. "
"Macromedia Flash. Note that, as with any browser, enabling active contents "
"can be a security problem."
msgstr ""
"Omogućava korištenje priključaka (plugin) za dijelove HTML stranica, npr. "
"Macromedia Flash. Ne zaboravite da je, kao i kod svakog preglednika, to "
"mogući izvor sigurnosnih problema."

#: pluginopts.cpp:78 pluginopts.cpp:430
msgid "Netscape Plugins"
msgstr "Netscape pluginovi"

#: pluginopts.cpp:175
msgid ""
"<h1>Konqueror Plugins</h1> The Konqueror web browser can use Netscape "
"plugins to show special content, just like the Navigator does. Please note "
"that the way you have to install Netscape plugins may depend on your "
"distribution. A typical place to install them is, for example, "
"'/opt/netscape/plugins'."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Konqueror pluginovi</h1> Konqueror web browser može koristiti Netscape "
"pluginove da prikaže neke posebne sadržaje, baš kao Navigator. Molim "
"zapamtite da način na koji instalirate Netscape pluginove može ovisiti o "
"vašoj distribuciji. Tipično mjesto na koje ih instalirate je, na primjer, "
"'/opt/netscape/plugins'."

#: pluginopts.cpp:192
msgid ""
"Do you want to apply your changes before the scan? Otherwise the changes "
"will be lost."
msgstr ""
"Želite li primijeniti vaše izmjene prije pretrage? Inače izmjene će biti "
"izgubljene."

#: pluginopts.cpp:201
msgid "Scanning for plugins"
msgstr "Tražim pluginove"

#: pluginopts.cpp:209
