msgstr "Traži nove pluginove pri startu &KDEa"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, KDE will look for new Netscape plugins every time "
"it starts up. This makes it easier for you if you often install new plugins, "
"but it may also slow down KDE startup. You might want to disable this "
"option, especially if you seldom install plugins."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ova opcija uključena, KDE će tražiti nove Netscape pluginove svaki "
"put prilikom pokretanja. Ovo vam olaškava ako često instalirate nove "
"pluginove, ali također može usporiti pokretanje KDEa. Možda želite "
"isključiti ovu opciju, posebno ako rijetko instalirate pluginove."

